OL,3,GNEWSAMan died of extreme cold in plane
OL,4,Alanding gear
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unidentified man found in a plane's
OL,7,Fwheel compartment at Gatwick Airport
OL,8,Fdied after being exposed to extreme
OL,9,Fcold and a lack of oxygen, an inquest
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FCoroner Joseph Turner opened the
OL,13,Finquest at Horsham Coroner's Court on
OL,14,FTuesday into the death of the man,
OL,15,Fwhose identity still remains unknown.
OL,17,FThe court heard his body was discovered
OL,18,Fin the landing gear compartment of an
OL,19,FAir Arabia flight which had arrived
OL,20,Ffrom Tangier, Morocco, on 16 June.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
